{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42621","headline":"寄当阳袁皓明府 · 杨夔","name":"寄当阳袁皓明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高人爲县在南京，竹遶琴堂水遶城。\n地古既资携酒兴，务闲偏长看山情。\n松轩待月僧同坐，药圃寻花鹤伴行。\n百里甚堪留惠爱，莫教空说鲁恭名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}